  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "panel_lines",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1284,
   "width": 1830,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "async workers \u2014 tokio default = host cores. They accept, parse, read bodies, and forward responses; never Lua, never FFI.\nblocking pool \u2014 tokio cap 512 threads. Busy threads in green stages \u2264 nthreads (the permit gate); red-dashed stages use it unguarded.\nadmission permits \u2014 nthreads global \u00b7 Full sub-pool = nthreads \u2212 tile_min (tiles always reach \u2265 tile_min). Queue: Full lane \u2264 max_waiting; both lanes shed 503 after queue_timeout.\nKakadu \u2014 each JP2 decode spawns \u2248 host-cores engine-internal worker threads (kdu_thread_env) for its duration; invisible to permits, RAM-gated by the engine memory budget.",
   "originalText": "async workers \u2014 tokio default = host cores. They accept, parse, read bodies, and forward responses; never Lua, never FFI.\nblocking pool \u2014 tokio cap 512 threads. Busy threads in green stages \u2264 nthreads (the permit gate); red-dashed stages use it unguarded.\nadmission permits \u2014 nthreads global \u00b7 Full sub-pool = nthreads \u2212 tile_min (tiles always reach \u2265 tile_min). Queue: Full lane \u2264 max_waiting; both lanes shed 503 after queue_timeout.\nKakadu \u2014 each JP2 decode spawns \u2248 host-cores engine-internal worker threads (kdu_thread_env) for its duration; invisible to permits, RAM-gated by the engine memory budget.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
